WEBVTT

00:15:59.224 --> 00:16:00.923
I also believe

00:16:00.947 --> 00:16:02.868
that in many parts of this country,

00:16:02.892 --> 00:16:05.428
and certainly in many parts of this globe,

00:16:06.445 --> 00:16:08.968
that the opposite of poverty
is not wealth.

00:16:09.753 --> 00:16:11.064
I don't believe that.

00:16:11.088 --> 00:16:13.726
I actually think, in too many places,

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:16.398
the opposite of poverty is justice.

00:16:17.097 --> 00:16:18.869
And finally, I believe

00:16:20.002 --> 00:16:23.713
that, despite the fact that it is
so dramatic and so beautiful

00:16:23.737 --> 00:16:26.283
and so inspiring and so stimulating,

00:16:26.307 --> 00:16:30.383
we will ultimately not be judged
by our technology,